HB0010 Limited mining operations-amendments.
Sponsored By: Joint Minerals, Business & Economic Development
Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to environmental quality; amending requirements for the
commencement of limited mining operations; amending bonding, notice and
reporting requirements for limited mining operations; limiting overburden
surface mining operations as specified; amending requirements for extending
limited mining operations; amending bond release provisions for limited mining
operations; authorizing rulemaking; and providing for effective dates.
