HB0010HS001/ADOPTED
Page 3-line 18 After "ballast" insert ", limestone". HEINER, CHAIRMAN
HB0010HW001/ADOPTED (CORRECTED COPY)
Page 1-line 14 Delete "and (J)" and insert "through (K)".
Page 8-after line 2 Insert:
"(K) Before an operator commences a limited mining
operation, the department may require the operator to test the water quality of
domestic wells within three hundred (300) feet of the proposed limited mining
operation for water quality parameters identified by the administrator of the
water quality division of the department. The department shall not require the
operator to sample any domestic wells that the well owner does not grant
permission for the operator to sample. The operator shall submit water quality
testing results to the administrator of the land quality division of the
department.". LAWLEY, HEINER
